   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "1995-02-14",
   "text": "Working Wage Increase Act of 1995 - Amends the Fair Labor Standards Act of 1938 to increase the minimum wage per hour to: (1) $4.70 during the year beginning July 4, 1995; and (2) $5.15 after July 3, 1996."
  }
